        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Center Of The World"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(divine, teleportation)\n\nTrigger: A creature finishes moving, even if it moved using something other than a move action\n\nSyndara is the figurative and literal center of this world. As the triggering creature moves, space reasserts itself, teleporting Syndara to be in the same position relative to the creature as he was when the creature began its movement. If the space he would teleport into is occupied, he displaces the obstructing creature or object into the nearest available space."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
            },
